(10, 10, 0, 'Cách đặt hàng trên Pharmacy Online:\nBước 1: Đăng nhập tài khoản.\nBước 2: Tìm sản phẩm bằng thanh tìm kiếm hoặc duyệt theo danh mục.\nBước 3: Thêm sản phẩm vào giỏ hàng, chọn số lượng.\nBước 4: Vào giỏ hàng, kiểm tra và chọn Thanh toán.\nBước 5: Nhập địa chỉ giao hàng, chọn phương thức thanh toán.\nBước 6: Xác nhận đơn hàng.\nBước 7: Theo dõi đơn hàng qua mục Đơn hàng của tôi.', '[0.015937185, -0.016319584, 0.001853279, -0.061849512, -0.009179109, 0.00498891, -0.00714022, 0.02060897, -0.012364794, -0.02626142, 0.01128987, 0.008561419, 0.0066798376, -0.018363968, 0.1267316, 0.004740903, -0.02360001, 0.020052997, -0.018961176, -0.03548713, -0.023577884, 0.021405024, -0.005283725, -0.018701008, 0.0017873829, -0.008028407, 0.0055750976, 0.030502124, 0.035584036, -0.00091572874, -0.0046037906, 0.008537413, -0.00041644514, -0.00066375243, 0.0021299748, 0.025905723, 0.00582763, -0.0059933467, 0.0033969758, -0.00029847908, 0.003734085, 0.021532182, -0.0127844475, -0.032677468, -0.01090772, 0.003471388, 0.026764147, -0.004601752, -0.008219933, -0.00816596, 0.0059891534, 0.015616809, -0.021399088, -0.18255615, -0.00934976, 0.006734191, -0.009686709, -0.0017742342, -0.0034639763, -0.015018013, 0.007500759, 0.027668973, -0.03302433, 0.0013223048, 0.014149534, -0.018409392, 0.0011073477, 0.011616629, 0.00844544, -0.026440864, -0.0031982246, 0.0032234017, -0.0008625967, 0.0045671784, 0.01400612, -0.016850049, -0.01013225, 0.02427586, 0.014308669, 0.015369331, -0.03399228, -0.0047998815, -0.007306812, -0.00013721304, 0.015619345, -0.01846807, 0.030263623, 0.0119608855, -0.0064290953, 0.021154428, -0.010248751, -0.0007264417, -0.0043819835, -0.0071558137, -0.0063045598, -0.003791, -0.02300393, -0.017049916, 0.0014754032, -0.0081714345, -0.018544808, -0.016285876, -0.015799321, -0.024222106, 0.008883433, -0.01456943, 0.053461198, -0.004297455, 0.02715865, -0.044110596, 0.014958852, 0.003511463, 0.012939929, 0.00020792433, 0.0009355773, -0.12885796, -0.0014507476, 0.009