(21, NULL, 0, 'Câu hỏi: Mua thuốc kê đơn thế nào?\nTrả lời: 📝 **Quy trình mua thuốc kê đơn:**\n1. Mang toa thuốc gốc của bác sĩ\n2. Đến quầy dược và xuất trình toa\n3. Dược sĩ sẽ kiểm tra và cấp phát thuốc\n\n⚠️ *Chúng tôi không bán thuốc kê đơn khi không có toa bác sĩ!*', '[0.0050111334, -0.014685636, 0.02109872, -0.049441367, -0.0031816212, -0.0074663996, 0.0064215004, 0.019341197, -0.023205323, -0.0139311915, -0.015676795, -0.00026042954, 0.00298581, -0.02210261, 0.12570547, -0.009298737, 0.0144500835, 0.01084382, -0.01209698, -0.021051511, 0.002530626, 0.0047314274, 0.0008609677, -0.030419098, -0.0061548883, -0.025665881, -0.00027944375, 0.03737372, 0.03777964, 0.015708884, -0.03224251, -0.0043178415, -0.019442938, 0.0074868468, 0.017885087, -0.0007560934, 0.037026897, -0.028708681, 0.0037701738, -0.013889408, -0.014101041, -0.009514296, -0.016691443, -0.0052381726, -0.0013957034, 0.0016828064, 0.017386623, -0.014345679, -0.018569313, 0.020422207, -0.004940507, -0.003700723, 0.007168043, -0.1957453, -0.031347476, -0.008819166, -0.0069627766, -0.012765576, -0.012016258, -0.02294021, 0.0067193485, 0.009574925, -0.025978468, -0.014451271, 0.010583655, -0.023022018, 0.004314914, 0.016617257, 0.021775622, -0.04933336, 0.0026123226, 0.011243339, 0.002020123, 0.027304947, 0.006702403, 0.01014743, -0.012833988, -0.00084875856, 0.0013729277, -0.024204701, -0.0014099507, -0.011876087, -0.01567929, -0.010119491, 0.016377479, -0.018194962, 0.015909191, 0.026490545, 0.0034732085, -0.00082645164, -0.01021316, 0.0018597252, 0.00319977, -0.0035825358, -0.03494919, -0.0013854004, -0.014278717, -0.0037755896, -0.021788178, 0.003144807, -0.009883545, -0.011642458, -0.015533858, 0.019991446, 0.0055268607, -0.033743314, 0.025637897, -0.00057891366, 0.027746208, -0.016758466, 0.018479535, -0.021532923, -0.009145219, -0.007985125, 0.0088351825, -0.1295841, -0.01937669, -0.016798785, 0.0004933223, -0.0052444926, -0.0056466036, -0.017847758, 0.008815256, 0.01967663, -0.015092513, -0.016