(30, NULL, 0, 'Câu hỏi: Giá thuốc bao nhiêu?\nTrả lời: 💰 Giá thuốc phụ thuộc vào từng loại. Bạn có thể:\n1. Tìm kiếm thuốc trên web để xem giá\n2. Hỏi trực tiếp tại quầy\n3. Chat với mình và cho biết tên thuốc cụ thể!\n\nChúng tôi cam kết giá cạnh tranh và có nhiều khuyến mãi hàng tuần! 🎁', '[0.0024217584, -0.0032917256, 0.011217901, -0.077347025, -0.024147348, -0.0027434465, -0.010133809, 0.0052988245, -0.019522669, -0.015114061, 0.008530227, 0.0030757252, 0.0017534796, -0.027874565, 0.1320365, -0.0013252981, 0.0214412, 0.00850058, 0.0018379017, -0.00079893746, -0.013227182, 0.041134033, 0.016976228, -0.026838886, -0.017117966, -0.012822594, 0.014649816, -0.002656938, 0.009838251, 0.021954231, -0.010234931, -0.0047584674, 0.0069113523, 0.010166388, 0.015602881, -0.005467292, 0.0145184435, -0.007856483, 0.0056816954, 0.01168515, -0.000025043368, 0.003235805, -0.013699113, -0.005603961, -0.016559254, 0.010798778, 0.006418309, -0.040395573, -0.0018443639, 0.026187202, -0.017433375, 0.011830144, -0.02126758, -0.18657354, -0.009019602, -0.012565004, -0.019962082, -0.004333974, 0.008449894, -0.023138126, -0.003413279, 0.02833673, -0.053147797, -0.012661881, 0.006575796, -0.020997021, 0.014248979, 0.037251946, 0.008748098, -0.034407984, -0.008721171, -0.0024823295, -0.029402155, 0.010674964, 0.008863176, -0.002063933, 0.014506127, -0.011648062, 0.017306104, -0.0155219035, 0.002686163, -0.0083476, -0.006485481, -0.00706993, 0.0066221463, -0.0161343, 0.018064689, 0.0054145255, 0.00708252, -0.0058802324, -0.012227501, 0.011806495, -0.014637298, -0.003086073, -0.0253239, -0.0010882001, 0.013731302, 0.001503367, -0.018779235, -0.0013775474, -0.0055002766, -0.010426454, 0.013294071, 0.01386968, 0.008741414, -0.010094413, 0.0015536319, 0.014811702, -0.00447884, -0.0011858954, -0.0024588087, -0.0075113317, 0.0059448928, -0.010600748, -0.00062931055, -0.14613602, 0.023873016, 0.011831462, -0.02327722, -0.024749665, -0.002401067, 0.031919323, 0.005895302, 0.02428052, -0.015942924, 